---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="FAQ - Alberti Home Buyers LLC">
  <!-- FAQ HERO -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-black text-brand-purple mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Find answers to common questions about selling your home to Alberti.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-sky font-bold mt-8"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">Still have questions? Call 443-327-9292</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST BAR -->
  <section class="py-6 bg-brand-cream-soft border-y border-black/5">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-10 gap-y-3 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-purple">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-orange">&#128274;</span> Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-orange">&#9201;</span> 24-Hour Cash Offers</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-orange">&#128205;</span> Serving All of Maryland</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-orange">&#128196;</span> No Fees, No Commissions</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ SECTION -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Q1 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple mb-4">How do you calculate your cash offer?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We evaluate several factors including the property's location, condition, market value, and potential for improvement. Our team will conduct a thorough inspection and provide you with a fair, competitive cash offer based on current market conditions. We don't use automated valuations—our experienced buyers personally assess each property.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-sky font-bold"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">Get your personalized offer: 443-327-9292</a></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Q2 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple mb-4">What if my house needs significant repairs?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We buy homes in any condition. Whether your house needs a roof replacement, foundation work, interior updates, or just cleaning, we'll still make a fair offer. You don't need to spend money on repairs before selling to us. We factor repair costs into our offer and handle all the work ourselves.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-sky font-bold"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">We buy as-is: 443-327-9292</a></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Q3 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple mb-4">What if I still have a mortgage?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            No problem at all. We handle the entire closing process, including paying off your mortgage balance. Our team will work with your lender to ensure everything is paid off correctly. You'll walk away with the cash difference after your mortgage is satisfied. Many of our customers had existing mortgages when they sold to us.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-sky font-bold"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">We handle everything: 443-327-9292</a></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Q4 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple mb-4">How long does the process take from start to finish?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong>Step 1: Initial Offer (24 hours)</strong> - Submit your property information and receive a cash offer within 24 hours. <strong>Step 2: Property Inspection (1-3 days)</strong> - We schedule a time to inspect the property. This is typically completed within a few days. <strong>Step 3: Final Offer (24 hours)</strong> - We provide a final cash offer based on our inspection. No appraisals or financing contingencies. <strong>Step 4: Closing (as fast as 7 days)</strong> - We handle all paperwork. You choose the closing date—some customers close in 7 days; others prefer to close in 30+ days.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-sky font-bold"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">Start today: 443-327-9292</a></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Q5 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple mb-4">Are there any hidden fees or commissions?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            No. We charge zero commissions and have no hidden fees. The cash offer we provide is what you receive after closing. We cover all closing costs, title work, and inspection fees. You don't pay real estate commissions (typically 5-6%), and you don't pay for repairs. This is why many homeowners choose to sell to us instead of listing on the traditional market.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-sky font-bold"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">No surprises: 443-327-9292</a></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Q6 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple mb-4">Do I have to accept your offer?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Absolutely not. Our offer is no-obligation. You're completely free to reject it, negotiate, or explore other options. We want you to feel confident in your decision. However, many customers find our offer is better than what they'd net after paying commissions and repairs on the traditional market.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-sky font-bold"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">Get your free offer: 443-327-9292</a></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Q7 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple mb-4">What areas do you service?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We buy homes throughout Baltimore and surrounding Maryland counties, including Towson, Columbia, Ellicott City, Catonsville, and more. We specialize in Baltimore properties but can work with homeowners in the greater Maryland area. If you're unsure whether we serve your area, call <a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">443-327-9292</a> and we'll let you know right away.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-sky font-bold"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">Check your area: 443-327-9292</a></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Q8 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple mb-4">What if there's a lien or tax issue on my property?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We can handle properties with liens, back taxes, or other legal issues. During the inspection process, we'll discuss any liens or claims against the property. We work with title companies to ensure everything is properly resolved at closing. You won't have to worry about these issues—we'll take care of them.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-sky font-bold"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">We handle complex situations: 443-327-9292</a></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Q9 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple mb-4">Do you buy rental properties and investment homes?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Yes! We buy all types of properties including single-family homes, rental properties, multi-unit buildings, condos, townhouses, and investment properties. Whether the property is occupied or vacant, in good condition or needs work, we can make you a fair cash offer.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-sky font-bold"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">All property types: 443-327-9292</a></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Q10 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple mb-4">Why should I trust Alberti?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We've been buying homes in Maryland for over 15 years. We have an A+ BBB rating and have purchased over 500 homes. We're a local business with deep roots in the community. Unlike some companies, we're transparent about our process, we don't use high-pressure tactics, and we treat every homeowner with respect. Read what our customers say—many have left positive reviews.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 italic mt-4">"The entire process was smooth and professional. I got my cash quickly. Highly recommend!" — Sarah Johnson, Baltimore</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-sky font-bold mt-4"><a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="hover:underline">Join 500+ satisfied customers: 443-327-9292</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FINAL CTA -->
      <div class="mt-16 bg-brand-purple text-white p-10 rounded-2xl text-center">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to get your cash offer?</h3>
        <p class="mb-8">We're here to help. Call us today or fill out our quick online form.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-brand-sky text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-brand-teal transition-all">
            Get Your Free Offer
          </a>
          <a href="tel:443-327-9292" class="inline-block bg-brand-sky text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-brand-teal transition-all">
            Call 443-327-9292
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
